(7696670, 1262474, 62357, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see this from a drone view point.  This place has so much meaning to me.  I had visitors staying with me in Chicago who had arrived on 7th September 2001.  We were at a Cubs game on the evening of the 8th September and well, we all know what happened the next day.  I''d only been living in Chicago 6 months at the time.  On the 10th September I took my friend to the Bahai temple in Wilmette where we just sat and reflected for hours.  Seeing it here brings this memory back so vividly.  Hard to believe it was 20 yrs ago this year.  Feels like yesterday.</td>', 'Interesting to see this from a drone view point.  This place has so much meaning to me.  I had visitors staying with me in Chicago who had arrived on 7th September 2001.  We were at a Cubs game on the evening of the 8th September and well, we all know what happened the next day.  I''d only been living in Chicago 6 months at the time.  On the 10th September I took my friend to the Bahai temple in Wilmette where we just sat and reflected for hours.  Seeing it here brings this memory back so vividly.  Hard to believe it was 20 yrs ago this year.  Feels like yesterday.', '2021-06-27 18:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
