(7696969, 1262334, 30214, '<td valign="top">Cool shot Barry, congrats! I was afraid to make a tiny planet out of my 360 deg drone panorama of a Mormon church in this challenge as I thought it would cross the line for the Standard ruleset, I guess I was wrong )).<br/> <br/>By the way, I was pretty sure that your shot was of <img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=77543" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DistantColours</a> in the process of taking his shot for this challenge (19th place). The setting is incredibly similar!</td>', 'Cool shot Barry, congrats! I was afraid to make a tiny planet out of my 360 deg drone panorama of a Mormon church in this challenge as I thought it would cross the line for the Standard ruleset, I guess I was wrong )). By the way, I was pretty sure that your shot was of  DistantColours in the process of taking his shot for this challenge (19th place). The setting is incredibly similar!', '2021-07-02 12:53:33.000000', NULL, 0),
